        {
          "speaker": "EMPLOYEE",
          "text": "Good morning, private banking, Daniel Lim speaking. How can I help? Before we get into your portfolio notes, could you provide your identification details for verification?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "CLIENT",
          "text": "Hi Daniel, Clara Tan here. [[EV_012]] [[EV_013]] I'm calling from home today, so I've got a quiet moment."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "EMPLOYEE",
          "text": "Thank you, Clara. I'll bring up your records. You can take your time getting your notes ready; there's no need to rush."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "CLIENT",
          "text": "I've got the notebook open beside me. [[EV_014]]"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "EMPLOYEE",
          "text": "While your records are loading, how have you found our telephone appointments compared with coming down to the branch?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "CLIENT",
          "text": "Telephone is much easier, actually. I can fit it around the family business without travelling. I've also been doing some gardening recently, mostly herbs on the balcony."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "EMPLOYEE",
          "text": "That's nice. My basil always seems to need attention just when I'm leaving for work. Have you managed to keep yours going?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "CLIENT",
          "text": "Yes, though I move it away from the afternoon sun. Hang on, I've turned back a page. [[EV_015]] [[EV_016]] [[EV_017]] [[EV_018]] [[EV_019]] [[EV_020]] [[EV_021]]"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "EMPLOYEE",
          "text": "[[EV_001]] [[EV_002]] [[EV_003]]"
        },
