          "text": "[[EV_007]]"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "EMPLOYEE",
          "text": "[[EV_008]]"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "CLIENT",
          "text": "Thank you, Daniel. I've got the right page in front of me now. The notebook is getting a bit untidy; I should put proper tabs in it."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "EMPLOYEE",
          "text": "[[EV_009]]"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "CLIENT",
          "text": "[[EV_010]] There's something else I need to tell you. [[EV_011]]"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "EMPLOYEE",
          "text": "Thank you for telling me. I need to refer this to our compliance team before taking any further action. They may contact you for supporting records."
